STRUDEL AND THE PLAYER

Strudel (https://codeberg.org/uzu/strudel), Copyright (C) Alex McLean and
contributors, is AGPL-3.0-or-later. It is not included in this repository.

The player that DJ Opus serves at /s/<id> is a modified build of the Strudel
REPL. `npm run build:strudel` (cloudflare/scripts/build-strudel.sh) makes it:
it clones Strudel at commit 9f19e4616a358ad31032e0f9af82060d23bc0d70, applies
cloudflare/patches/strudel/*.patch in order, builds the site, and adds
cloudflare/client/strudel-ws-bridge.js and cloudflare/client/_headers. That
commit, those patches, that script and those two files are the Corresponding
Source of the player. The player links to this repository ("Source") and to
the Strudel commit ("Strudel").

The bridge script (cloudflare/client/strudel-ws-bridge.js) is this project's
own code under the MIT License, which is compatible with the AGPL. The player
as served, Strudel and the bridge together, is covered by the AGPL.

If you deploy a modified player (other patches, another Strudel commit, or a
changed bridge), the AGPL asks you to offer its source to the people who use
it: change the "Source" link (SOURCE_LINKS in
cloudflare/client/strudel-ws-bridge.js) to point at your copy.

